Subject: [PATCH 39/50] Sync the liveness engine: F17 installZip verifies
 before it compares versions

Engine jars from Mosip26 2e389a0 (f17-offline-model-install: "F17:
installZip verifies a bundle before it compares versions"). A tampered
or badly signed zip is now BUNDLE_INVALID whatever version it claims,
instead of being reported as not newer. The models and
CameraXFrameSource.java are unchanged (same SHA-256).

Tested together with the next commit, which adds the Android test for
it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
